  "description": "At the funeral of So-Ha, the lover who died in an accident, Do-Yeol meets Go-Eun, the old friend of his lover.\nAt first realising that both of them were people who love So-Ha, they act wary of each other, and Go-Eun who misses her too much.\nDo-Yeol soon asks the other to talk about the story of So-Ha. The two of them meet up in So-Ha's room and decide to talk about what they knew regarding her.\nDo-Yeol soon gets too involved in the talks, or maybe because of the alcohol starts mistake Go-Eun for his lover and embraces him...!\n\n(Source: WebNovel)",
